he game scenes! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228660/extras/a582d75ea21bf69f09ae20afb687fa2f.poster.avif?t=1771119953\" width=616 height=92 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228660/extras/a582d75ea21bf69f09ae20afb687fa2f.webm?t=1771119953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228660/extras/a582d75ea21bf69f09ae20afb687fa2f.mp4?t=1771119953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzle at will. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Brilliant Jigsaw</strong>, you have complete freedom: puzzle whenever you want, with the ability to save at any time; puzzle whatever image you want by unlocking it with in-game rewards; puzzle however you like, with the freedom to choose and combine various abilities, creating your own unique gameplay style. Additionally, there are multiple themes and color schemes for you to choose from. With this game, you have endless puzzles and limitless possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228660/extras/820a3d8f2673bc0170aafa8e63987f2a.poster.avif?t=1771119953\" width=616 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228660/extras/820a3d8f2673bc0170aafa8e63987f2a.webm?t=1771119953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228660/extras/820a3d8f2673bc0170aafa8e63987f2a.mp4?t=1771119953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich and diverse gameplay. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle images range from the budding of life to futuristic communities, from vast landscapes to the cosmos, from treasures to humanity's earliest emotions... With a variety of content, 20+ abilities, and hundreds of combinations to explore, <strong>Brilliant Jigsaw</strong> shatters the boundaries of traditional puzzle-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Brilliant Jigsaw</u></strong><u> is not just a puzzle game, but a journey of discovery and exploration.</u></p>","developers":["BrillianT"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228660/header.jpg?t=1771119953","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3228660/772174/0200ef87336b37d1565e30b4b94a3bdc825e7032/1750882886/dash_av1.mpd?t=1728989188","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3228660/772174/0200ef87336b37d1565e30b4b94a3bdc825e7032/1750882886/dash_h264.mpd?t=1728989188","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3228660/772174/0200ef87336b37d1565e30b4b94a3bdc825e7032/1750882886/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1728989188","id":257065326,"name":"Brilliant Jigsaw - Puzzle of The Frankland Sisters","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257065326/9cfb6e6fb074efcde756f4c38d359356db16f0d3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1728989188"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3228660/771406/12461f8e020aa192f2c8ea8604f94e9b86683589/1750882883/dash_av1.mpd?t=1728887157","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3228660/771406/12461f8e020aa192f2c8ea8604f94e9b